    "case_ref": null,
    "case_facts_html": null,
    "question_html": "<p>If set A has 32 elements, set B has 42 elements, and n(A ∪ B) = 62, then the number of elements in n(A ∩ B) is:</p>",
    "options": {
      "A": "12",
      "B": "74",
      "C": "10",
      "D": "20"
    },
    "correct_option": "A",
    "answer_html": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (A) 12 — By cardinal formula: n(A ∪ B) = n(A) + n(B) - n(A ∩ B)[cite: 14] ⇒ 62 = 32 + 42 - n(A ∩ B) ⇒ n(A ∩ B) = 12[cite: 14].</p>",
