    "correct_option": "A",
    "answer_html": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (A) [0, 1] — At x = 0, f(0) = log₁₀(1) = 0[cite: 14]. At x = 9, f(9) = log₁₀(10) = 1[cite: 14]. Since log₁₀(1 + x) is increasing on [0, 9], range is [0, 1][cite: 14].</p>",
